  "metadata": {
    "name": "hooked",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "spec": "0.1.0",
    "description": "100x.broker: \u00b1100\u00d7 power-leverage pairs (UP / DOWN) on any coin with a Raydium CLMM pool. Both sides trade on Meteora DBC transfer-hook curves quoted in r-freestacc; every transfer of either token re-settles the two pots at power leverage 100 against the pool's TWAP (self-sampled from the pool tick when the ring is dead). Written in Pinocchio; instruction discriminators are one byte except the SPL transfer-hook Execute.",
    "repository": "https://100x.broker"
  },
