    {
      "name": "execute",
      "docs": [
        "SPL transfer-hook Execute: called by Token-2022 on every UP/DOWN transfer. Rebalances the pots at 1.0001^(-100\u00b7\u0394tick) against the oracle TWAP. Extra accounts come from the ExtraAccountMetaList."
